{"id":"n62280-1-12","stage":3,"title":"꾸미다 · 装饰","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62280-1-12-1","ko":"여보, 이사 가면 집을 어떻게 꾸밀까?","zh":"亲爱的，等我们搬家后，要怎么布置房子呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보,","meaning":"喂，老婆，老公","explanation":"여보：喂，老婆，老公。","readings":[{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58165","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}},{"text":"이사","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家。","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}},{"text":"가면","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가면","audio":"/audio/3f7693768451c0cae806.mp3"}},{"text":"집을","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집을","audio":"/audio/cd6aaeb8eea1e3b476ad.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"꾸밀까?","meaning":"装饰，装扮","explanation":"꾸미다：装饰，装扮；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"꾸미다","audio":"/audio/c5ea965384e83ecff041.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62280","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸미